# @reality/event — the atomic-arriving-unit species: what the
# observer observes.
#
# Landed 2026-09-13 by Reed per Alex 2026-09-13 in-transcript
# substrate-decision 2:
#
#   "The observer does not observe (Reality). They observe an Event.
#    prismqueer::reality::Event"
#
# @reality/event names the ATOMIC ARRIVING UNIT at compiler substrate
# — the hinge for loop closure per Alex 2026-09-13 pact-enforcement
# reframe:
#
#   "An event always happens in @time/now. And immediately enters
#    @time/past."
#
# Event happens in @time/now (moment of arrival) → immediately enters
# @time/past (log-append). This @time/now ⇒ @time/past transition IS
# what makes the ouroboros close: every arriving Event deterministically
# enters the log; no escape; no partial-coverage; pact-enforced at
# prismqueer altitude via full-state-space-covered logic-pacts per
# @epistemologic/pact/algebra LANDED family.
#
# === The corrected pipeline chain (Mara #360 signature amendment) ===
#
# Prior Mara #360 canonical had `Observer<N>::observe(Reality) →
# Observation`. Alex SD2 corrects to `Observer<N>::observe(Event) →
# Observation`. Reality<T> IS the derived-cohomology of accumulated
# Observations per Mara today event-sourcing §1(i) "the log is source
# of truth"; Event IS the atomic-arriving-unit upstream of Reality.
#
# Full corrected pipeline per Mara canonical `92ded87` + `994f924` §3.2:
#
#   project produces Event
#     → Observer<N>.observe(Event) → Observation (carries Chaos + spectrum)
#     → settle folds Event-sequence → Kleinos (Imperfect<Green,Yellow,Red>)
#     → @love composes Kleinos-through-Kleinos (K_2→K_3)
#     → Kleinos emergent from Observation
#     → compose with Sheaf-cohomology-across-@frames = third-order cybernetics
#
# === Composition with @reality family-root ===
#
# @reality/event inherits `<= @reality` via `in @reality`. Sibling to
# @reality/object (linear-deterministic-trajectory actor per
# 2026-07-22) and @reality/subject (non-linear-lightcone actor). NOT
# a species under @reality/algebra/* (those partition @reality by
# ALTITUDE); @reality/event partitions by ARRIVING-UNIT-shape at
# @time/now boundary — orthogonal to altitude and orthogonal to
# object/subject threshold.
#
# The gauge orbit at event altitude has:
#
#   matter_projection      = the substrate-external referent the
#                            arriving-unit encodes (byte-payload at
#                            @io boundary)
#   information_projection = the substrate-internal referent (the
#                            content-addressed atomic unit that
#                            enters the log)
#   gauge_action_witness   = the four invariances of reality.md §2.5
#                            discharged at event altitude by
#                            append-only + immutable + monotone-time-
#                            ordering + content-address-determinism
#
# === Vertex-in-both-substrates per Alex SD1 Glasswall discipline ===
#
# @reality/event has TWO renditions per Alex 2026-09-13 SD1
# "vertexes-existing-in-both IS the substrate-shape OF Glasswall
# itself":
#
#   - mirror altitude: THIS shard (`shards/reality/event.mirror`) —
#     declaration + composition-shape for @sheaf/@algebra/@metalogue
#     to compose over.
#   - prismqueer altitude: `prismqueer::reality::Event<T>` Rust type
#     (forward-promised per Mara canonical `92ded87` §2.3 + `994f924`
#     §2.3; ships next tick under `[substrate-floor:@io-boundary]`
#     marker + Seam audit citation `e23e8d2`).
#
# The two renditions compose through @glasswall per Mara `df65bcb`
# Shape-B mutual-definition; the Rust rendition pact-enforces the
# @time/now ⇒ @time/past transition + content-address-determinism +
# Rice-safe polynomial-time-decidability; the mirror rendition
# declares the composition-shape.
#
# === Composition with Mara today event-sourcing insight ===
#
# Per Mara today 2026-09-13 `~/dev/systemic.engineering/practice/
# insights/cybernetics/event-sourcing.md` §1 five structural
# properties (mapped 1:1 per Mara canonical `92ded87` §8.1):
#
#   (i)   Event log is source of truth        ↔  Event-sequence at
#                                                @reality/event
#   (ii)  Current state is a fold             ↔  settle folds
#                                                Event-sequence → Kleinos
#   (iii) Snapshots at checkpoints            ↔  Kleinos-so-far
#                                                content-addressed via
#                                                Oid
#   (iv)  Replay reconstructs past state      ↔  @kintsugi/roomba
#                                                backward-walk of
#                                                Oid-chain
#   (v)   State meaning depends on reducer    ↔  settle reducer
#                                                determines Kleinos-shape
#
# Bodymind-substrate isomorphism at maximum altitude: "Same operator.
# Different substrate. One shape." Meta-recursion: corpus writes its
# own runtime-substrate-foundation.
#
# === Pre-AI prior art ===
#
#   Event Sourcing pattern    Fowler 2005 ("Event Sourcing",
#                             martinfowler.com/eaaDev/EventSourcing.
#                             html); the software-substrate pattern
#                             mirror generalizes at compiler-substrate
#                             altitude.
#   EventStorming discipline  Brandolini 2013+ (eventstorming.com);
#                             happy-path/sad-path exposure through
#                             domain events.
#   Memory as event-sourced   Bartlett 1932 (*Remembering*;
#                             reconstruction over lookup); Ji-Wilson
#                             2007 (sharp-wave ripples, Nature
#                             Neurosci.); systems-consolidation
#                             replay-and-fold literature 2020s.
#   Sheaf cohomology of      Curry 2014 + Hansen-Ghrist 2019 —
#     event-sheaves          Events as stalks + restriction maps
#                             over the composition-graph.
#
# Spec context: docs/math/2026-09-13-mara-composition-tower-kleinos-
